B('street-capsule-hotel', 5, 5, 30, 'capsule hotel', 'A capsule hotel, 80 px wide and 80 px tall in total. ROOF (rows 0-29): flat dark roof deck seen from above (s_dark, s_hull tones 0-2) with a parapet rim, seams, two water tanks (ellipse tops), a vent box; a green neon tube line along the front parapet. WALL (rows 30-79): blue-grey wall (s_hull tones 1-3), 2-row eave shadow; upper part (rows 33-52): a grid of small round capsule windows, 2 rows x 4 in this half (each about 6 px, some lit warm yellow, some lit cyan, some dark); a floor band; ground part (rows 54-79): a lobby window lit warm yellow (about 14x12), a small vertical neon sign (a_magenta shapes); at the centre line the entrance (opening 16 px wide in total: draw its left 8 columns touching column 39; 24 px tall, reaching the last row; glass door); blue-grey base course on the last 3 rows.')
